msgid "**Returns:**"
msgstr "**返回值：**"

#: manual/api/differentiation.md:12
msgid "`Some(weights)`, where `weights[i][k]` is the weight of `nodes[i]` in the approximation of the `k`-th derivative at `center`, for `k` from `0` to `derivative_order`. Returns `None` if `derivative_order` is negative, if there are not more than `derivative_order` nodes, or if two nodes coincide."
msgstr "`Some(weights)`，其中 `weights[i][k]` 是 `nodes[i]` 在 `center` 处 `k` 阶导数近似中的权重，`k` 取 `0` 到 `derivative_order`。如果 `derivative_order` 为负、节点数不多于 `derivative_order`，或有两个节点重合，则返回 `None`。"

#: manual/api/differentiation.md:14
#: manual/api/legacy_deriv.md:33
#: manual/api/legacy_deriv.md:67
#: manual/api/legacy_deriv.md:101
#: manual/api/legacy_diff.md:33
#: manual/api/legacy_diff.md:58
#: manual/api/legacy_diff.md:90
msgid "**Notes:**"
msgstr "**注意事项：**"

#: manual/api/differentiation.md:16
msgid "The stencil is exact for polynomials of degree below the number of nodes."
msgstr "对于次数小于节点数的多项式，该模板是精确的。"

#: manual/api/differentiation.md:17
msgid "Badly spread nodes make the weights ill-conditioned; the function does not detect this."
msgstr "节点分布不佳会使权重病态；函数不会检测这一点。"

