msgid "2.2 Algorithm sources"
msgstr "2.2 算法资料"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:28
msgid "Implementations are based on papers and published algorithm descriptions; mature libraries are consulted only to cross-check interfaces and behavior:"
msgstr "实现以论文和公开算法描述为依据，参考成熟库仅用于交叉验证接口与行为："

