#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:40
msgid "Standard formal power series algorithms"
msgstr "形式幂级数标准算法"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:40
msgid "Supports evaluation, differentiation, integration and basic composition"
msgstr "支持求值、导数、积分和组合基础"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:42
msgid "GSL is GPL software. This project may compare its public behavior and the papers it cites, but must not copy, translate or structurally rewrite its source code."
msgstr "GSL 是 GPL 软件。本项目可以比较其公开行为和论文出处，但不得复制、翻译或结构性改写其源代码。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:44
msgid "3. Dependency boundaries"
msgstr "3. 依赖边界"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:46
msgid "Dependencies must stay one-way:"
msgstr "依赖必须保持单向："

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:56
msgid "This phase does not modify `arithmetic` or `floating`. Ordinary algebraic operations compose the existing traits directly; inside calculus, minimal providers are used only for capabilities that are missing and depend on a context. Once validation has stabilized, a separate RFC will move the general `next_up`, numerical-format and context capabilities up into `arithmetic`, and `floating` will implement the Decimal/BinFloat instances."
msgstr "本阶段不修改 `arithmetic` 与 `floating`。普通代数运算直接组合现有 trait；calculus 内部只为缺失且依赖 context 的能力使用极小 provider。验证稳定后，再提交独立 RFC 将通用的 `next_up`、数值格式和 context 能力上移到 `arithmetic`，并由 `floating` 实现 Decimal/BinFloat 实例。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:58
msgid "`floating` must not depend on calculus. The context capabilities of the existing Decimal types are provided by provider values owned by calculus; non-context capabilities such as addition, subtraction, multiplication, division, comparison, zero and one continue to use trait composition."
msgstr "不得让 `floating` 依赖 calculus。现有 Decimal 类型的 context 能力由 calculus 拥有的 provider 值完成；加减乘除、比较、零、一等非 context 能力继续使用 trait composition。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:60
msgid "4. Type system decisions"
msgstr "4. 类型系统决策"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:62
msgid "4.1 A single scalar and value type in the first phase"
msgstr "4.1 第一阶段统一标量和值域"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:64
msgid "Stable entry points use `(T) -> T`. The current MoonBit/Luna-Flow ecosystem has no mature public capability that expresses the following relations:"
msgstr "稳定入口采用 `(T) -> T`。当前 MoonBit/Luna-Flow 生态没有成熟表达以下关系的公共能力："

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:72
msgid "Vector scaling in `linear-algebra` currently uses the same element type as well. A public three-type `S/V/E` API would force callers to pass large function tables and could introduce indirect calls into integration hot paths. Integration over vectors, matrices and heterogeneous value types is therefore deferred to a separate RFC."
msgstr "`linear-algebra` 当前的向量缩放也使用相同元素类型。公开 `S/V/E` 三类型 API 会迫使调用者传递大块函数表，并可能在积分热点中引入间接调用。因此向量、矩阵和异构值域积分推迟到独立 RFC。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:74
msgid "4.2 Trait composition plus minimal providers"
msgstr "4.2 Trait composition 加最小 provider"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:76
msgid "No `RealNumber` trait bundling all elementary functions is added, and existing trait operations are not rewrapped into function tables. Algorithms take the minimal capabilities they need through trait composition:"
msgstr "不新增包含全部初等函数的 `RealNumber` trait，也不把已有 trait 运算重新包装进函数表。算法通过 trait composition 接收自己需要的最小能力："

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:78
msgid "Core scalars: compose existing traits such as `Zero`, `One`, `IntegralHomomorphism`, `Add`, `Sub`, `Mul`, `Div` and `Compare` directly."
msgstr "核心标量：直接组合 `Zero`、`One`、`IntegralHomomorphism`、`Add`、`Sub`、`Mul`、`Div`、`Compare` 等已有 trait。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:79
msgid "Numerical format: epsilon, adjacent values, minimum normal, maximum finite, value classification."
msgstr "数值格式：epsilon、相邻值、最小 normal、最大 finite、值分类。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:80
msgid "Optional capabilities: context-aware `sqrt`, integer powers and parsing."
msgstr "可选能力：context-aware `sqrt`、整数幂和解析。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:82
msgid "Only context-dependent operations that existing traits cannot express correctly use a minimal provider, for example a context one of type `(Context) -> T` and a next-up of type `(T, Context) -> T`. Once stable, these capabilities move up into `arithmetic`."
msgstr "只有无法由现有 trait 正确表达的 context-dependent 操作使用极小 provider，例如 `(Context) -> T` 的 context one 和 `(T, Context) -> T` 的 next-up。稳定后这些能力再上移到 `arithmetic`。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:84
msgid "4.3 Context and epsilon"
msgstr "4.3 Context 与 epsilon"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:86
msgid "The format constants of `Float` and `Double` are determined by the type. The epsilon and range of Decimal are determined jointly by the precision, the exponent range and the rounding context, so a parameterless Decimal `epsilon()` must not be provided."
msgstr "`Float` 和 `Double` 的格式常量由类型决定。Decimal 的 epsilon 和范围由 precision、指数范围及舍入上下文共同决定，因此不得提供无参数的 Decimal `epsilon()`。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:88
msgid "The working epsilon of Decimal is defined as:"
msgstr "Decimal 的工作 epsilon 定义为："

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:94
msgid "An algorithm entry point builds a derived environment once and caches epsilon, sqrt(epsilon) and commonly used coefficients. Hot loops must not repeatedly construct contexts, convert rule tables or compute format constants."
msgstr "算法入口构造一次派生环境，缓存 epsilon、sqrt(epsilon) 与常用系数。热点循环不得反复构造 context、转换规则表或计算格式常量。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:96
msgid "5. Draft packages and public API"
msgstr "5. 包与公开 API 草案"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:107
msgid "Suggested result shapes:"
msgstr "建议结果形状："

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:126
msgid "`NumericalStatus` distinguishes at least completion, resource exhaustion, invalid tolerance, rounding stagnation, suspected singularity, non-finite input/output and context arithmetic failure. Low-level Decimal flags should be aggregated into the diagnostics rather than compressed into a single integer error code."
msgstr "`NumericalStatus` 至少区分完成、资源耗尽、无效容差、舍入停滞、疑似奇点、非有限输入/输出和 context arithmetic failure。底层 Decimal flags 应聚合到 diagnostics，而不是压缩成单个整数错误码。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:128
msgid "6. Algorithm boundaries"
msgstr "6. 算法边界"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:130
msgid "6.1 Derivatives"
msgstr "6.1 导数"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:132
msgid "The rule layer generates Fornberg weights from the nodes and the derivative order; rule objects can be cached."
msgstr "规则层根据节点和导数阶生成 Fornberg 权重，规则对象可缓存。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:133
msgid "The execution layer is only responsible for sampling and weighting."
msgstr "执行层只负责采样和加权。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:134
msgid "The control layer adjusts the step size with Richardson/Ridders and reports truncation and rounding errors."
msgstr "控制层使用 Richardson/Ridders 调整步长并报告截断与舍入误差。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:135
msgid "`autodiff` stays independent; calculus only provides an optional bridge and guidance on choosing an algorithm, and does not reimplement dual numbers."
msgstr "`autodiff` 保持独立；calculus 只提供可选 bridge 和算法选择说明，不重复实现 dual number。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:137
msgid "6.2 Integration"
msgstr "6.2 积分"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:139
msgid "`QuadratureRule[T]` stores nodes, Gauss weights and extension weights, each with a documented source."
msgstr "`QuadratureRule[T]` 保存有来源的节点、Gauss 权重和扩展权重。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:140
msgid "Fixed rules are separate from the adaptive controller; the controller does not know where the rule coefficients come from."
msgstr "固定规则与自适应 controller 分离；controller 不知道规则系数来源。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:141
msgid "The adaptive workspace allows local mutation but exposes no mutable state."
msgstr "自适应工作区允许局部 mutation，但不暴露可变状态。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:142
msgid "Double/Float rules use concrete static tables; Decimal/BinFloat rules are converted once for the context at the entry point and cached for that call."
msgstr "Double/Float 规则使用具体静态表；Decimal/BinFloat 规则在入口按 context 转换一次并缓存于本次调用。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:143
msgid "Tanh–Sinh does not depend on fixed-precision tables and is the preferred complement for high-precision and endpoint-singular cases."
msgstr "Tanh–Sinh 不依赖固定精度表，作为高精度和端点奇异场景的首选补充。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:145
msgid "6.3 Series"
msgstr "6.3 级数"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:147
msgid "Finite sequences provide naive, pairwise and Kahan/Neumaier summation, so that no single `sum` implicitly chooses the cost of precision."
msgstr "有限序列提供 naive、pairwise、Kahan/Neumaier，不让一个 `sum` 隐式选择精度成本。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:148
msgid "Infinite series must be given an explicit tolerance and maximum number of terms, and return the number of terms used and the reason for termination."
msgstr "无限级数必须显式给出容差与最大项数，并返回使用项数与终止原因。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:149
msgid "Convergence acceleration is a composable strategy and is not mixed into sequence generators."
msgstr "收敛加速作为可组合策略，不混入序列生成器。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:150
msgid "`PowerSeries[T]` stores its truncation order explicitly; conversion to and from `luna-poly` is an explicit adapter, and a truncated series is not treated as an ordinary polynomial."
msgstr "`PowerSeries[T]` 明确保存截断阶；与 `luna-poly` 的转换是显式 adapter，不把截断级数等同于普通多项式。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:152
msgid "7. Legacy migration"
msgstr "7. Legacy 迁移"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:154
msgid "The migration proper spans two releases:"
msgstr "正式迁移分两个版本："

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:156
msgid "When the new packages are released, the old entry points forward to `legacy/*`, and the documentation marks them deprecated and provides an item-by-item migration table."
msgstr "新包发布时，旧入口转发到 `legacy/*`，文档标记弃用并提供逐项迁移表。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:157
msgid "The next major version removes legacy; serious correctness issues are still fixed, but legacy receives no new algorithms or numeric types."
msgstr "下一个主版本删除 legacy；严重正确性问题仍修复，但 legacy 不再新增算法或数值类型。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:159
msgid "During this RFC phase no existing files are moved, to avoid creating compatibility changes before the new API has been validated."
msgstr "本 RFC 阶段不移动现有文件，避免在新 API 尚未验证前制造兼容性变化。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:161
msgid "8. Validation gates"
msgstr "8. 验证门槛"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:163
msgid "Each area first delivers one Double/Decimal vertical slice before the number of algorithms is expanded."
msgstr "每个领域先交付一个 Double/Decimal 纵向切片，再扩展算法数量。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:164
msgid "The target overhead of the Double adapter prototype relative to a direct implementation is at most 15%; hot loops must not allocate per item."
msgstr "Double adapter 原型相对直接实现的目标开销不超过 15%，热点循环不得逐项分配。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:165
msgid "Decimal uses one explicit context throughout; tests must cover inexact, rounded, underflow, overflow and invalid operation."
msgstr "Decimal 全程使用同一个显式 context；测试必须覆盖 inexact、rounded、underflow、overflow 和 invalid operation。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:166
msgid "Analytic functions, hard functions and high-precision oracles are tested in separate layers; the actual error and the reported error are recorded separately."
msgstr "解析函数、困难函数与高精度 oracle 分层测试；实际误差与报告误差分别记录。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:167
msgid "Property tests cover linearity, interval reversal, constant functions, scaling relations, tolerance monotonicity and series truncation consistency."
msgstr "性质测试覆盖线性、区间反转、常数函数、缩放关系、容差单调性和级数截断一致性。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:169
msgid "9. Follow-up RFCs"
msgstr "9. 后续 RFC"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:171
msgid "Move the stable numerical-format capabilities up into `arithmetic`."
msgstr "将稳定的数值格式能力上移到 `arithmetic`。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:172
msgid "Separation of scalar and value types, and integration over vectors, matrices and complex numbers."
msgstr "标量和值域分离及向量/矩阵/复数积分。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:173
msgid "Certified integration with BallFloat/interval arithmetic."
msgstr "BallFloat/区间数的 certified integration。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:174
msgid "Fourier series and the boundary with the FFT ecosystem."
msgstr "Fourier 级数与 FFT 生态边界。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:175
msgid "ODE/PDE solvers; these are outside this foundational phase."
msgstr "ODE/PDE 求解器；不属于本基础能力阶段。"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:177
msgid "References"
msgstr "参考资料"

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:179
msgid "B. Fornberg, “Generation of Finite Difference Formulas on Arbitrarily Spaced Grids”, 1988."
msgstr "B. Fornberg, “Generation of Finite Difference Formulas on Arbitrarily Spaced Grids”, 1988."

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:180
msgid "B. Fornberg, “Calculation of Weights in Finite Difference Formulas”, 1998."
msgstr "B. Fornberg, “Calculation of Weights in Finite Difference Formulas”, 1998."

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:181
msgid "R. Piessens et al., *QUADPACK: A Subroutine Package for Automatic Integration*, 1983."
msgstr "R. Piessens et al., *QUADPACK: A Subroutine Package for Automatic Integration*, 1983."

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:182
msgid "H. Takahasi and M. Mori, “Double Exponential Formulas for Numerical Integration”, 1974."
msgstr "H. Takahasi and M. Mori, “Double Exponential Formulas for Numerical Integration”, 1974."

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:183
msgid "L. N. Trefethen, “Is Gauss Quadrature Better than Clenshaw–Curtis?”, 2008."
msgstr "L. N. Trefethen, “Is Gauss Quadrature Better than Clenshaw–Curtis?”, 2008."

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:184
msgid "P. Wynn, “On a Device for Computing the e_m(S_n) Transformation”, 1956."
msgstr "P. Wynn, “On a Device for Computing the e_m(S_n) Transformation”, 1956."

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:185
msgid "IEEE 754-2019, *Standard for Floating-Point Arithmetic*."
msgstr "IEEE 754-2019, *Standard for Floating-Point Arithmetic*."

#: manual/architecture_rfc.md:186
msgid "General Decimal Arithmetic Specification and decNumber test suite."
msgstr "General Decimal Arithmetic Specification and decNumber test suite."

#: manual/contributing.md:1
msgid "Contribution guidelines"
msgstr "贡献规范"

#: manual/contributing.md:3
msgid "To contributors"
msgstr "致贡献者"

#: manual/contributing.md:5
msgid "We warmly welcome developers familiar with various scientific computing libraries related to numerical calculus to join the project, contribute code, and share their valuable experiences. At the same time, we encourage beginners to learn and master numerical methods related to calculus by participating in development and improving documentation. In this project, we hope that both experienced developers and beginners can find contribution goals that interest them by reviewing the project's documentation, tables, and code examples."
msgstr "我们热烈欢迎熟悉各类微积分数值求解相关科学计算库的开发者加入本项目，贡献代码并分享宝贵的经验。同时，我们鼓励初学者通过参与开发和改进文档来学习和掌握微积分相关的数值方法。在本项目中，我们希望无论是有经验的开发者还是初学者，都能通过查阅项目文档、示例和代码找到自己感兴趣的贡献目标。"

#: manual/contributing.md:7
msgid "We sincerely thank all the developers who have contributed to this project. Whether through submitting code, improving documentation, or providing valuable feedback, every effort you make helps to make this project better. Your enthusiasm and wisdom in the development process continually drive the project forward, and bring more opportunities for collaboration within the community. We appreciate your support and dedication, and we look forward to achieving more together, driving this project toward an even brighter future!"
msgstr "我们衷心感谢所有为本项目做出贡献的开发者。无论是提交代码、完善文档，还是提供宝贵的反馈，你的每一份努力都让这个项目变得更好。你们在开发过程中的热情与智慧不断推动项目前进，也为社区带来了更多合作的机会。感谢你们的支持与付出，期待与大家携手取得更多成果，让这个项目迎来更加光明的未来！"

#: manual/contributing.md:9
msgid "1. Code style"
msgstr "1. 代码风格"

#: manual/contributing.md:11
msgid "The project follows the formatting style enforced by the MoonBit Toolchain. Format your code automatically using the following command:"
msgstr "统一采用 MoonBit Toolchain 的格式化风格，通过运行以下命令来自动格式化代码。"

#: manual/contributing.md:17
msgid "Ensure that you run `moon fmt` before committing your code to maintain consistency."
msgstr "请确保在提交代码之前，使用 `moon fmt` 格式化代码，以保持一致的代码风格。"

#: manual/contributing.md:19
msgid "The project is built and tested with the latest MoonBit toolchain; the compiler version is not pinned, and CI installs the newest release. Fix incompatibilities in the code instead of pinning an older compiler. Before opening a pull request, check all four backends with `moon check --target all --deny-warn` and run `moon test --target wasm`, `wasm-gc`, `js` and `native`."
msgstr "本项目使用最新的 MoonBit 工具链构建和测试；编译器版本不做固定，CI 会安装最新发布版。遇到不兼容之处请修改代码，而不要固定旧版编译器。提交 Pull Request 之前，请用 `moon check --target all --deny-warn` 检查全部四个后端，并分别以 `wasm`、`wasm-gc`、`js` 和 `native` 运行 `moon test --target`。"

#: manual/contributing.md:21
msgid "Alternatively, you can use the `ready_to_pr.sh` script to automatically format the code, run checks, generate test coverage files, and create `.mbti` files."
msgstr "或者，可以使用 `ready_to_pr.sh` 脚本来自动格式化代码、运行检查、生成测试覆盖率文件和 `.mbti` 文件。"

#: manual/contributing.md:23
msgid "2. Naming conventions"
msgstr "2. 命名约定"

#: manual/contributing.md:25
msgid "2.1 Variable naming"
msgstr "2.1 变量命名"

#: manual/contributing.md:27
msgid "Use **lowercase letters with underscores** as separators (e.g., `my_var`)."
msgstr "采用 **小写字母和下划线** 分隔（例如：`my_var`）。"

#: manual/contributing.md:28
msgid "Variable names should be descriptive and clearly indicate their purpose."
msgstr "变量名应具有描述性，能够准确反映其用途。"

#: manual/contributing.md:30
msgid "2.2 Function naming"
msgstr "2.2 函数命名"

#: manual/contributing.md:32
msgid "Use **lowercase letters with underscores** as separators (e.g., `calc_total_price()`)."
msgstr "使用 **小写字母和下划线** 分隔（例如：`calc_total_price()`）。"

#: manual/contributing.md:33
msgid "Function names should be concise and descriptive, clearly expressing their functionality."
msgstr "函数名应简洁且具有描述性，能够清晰表达函数的功能。"

#: manual/contributing.md:35
msgid "2.3 Struct and trait naming"
msgstr "2.3 Struct 和 Trait 命名"

#: manual/contributing.md:37
msgid "Use **PascalCase** (e.g., `MyStruct`, `MyTrait`)."
msgstr "使用 **首字母大写的驼峰式命名**（例如：`MyStruct`、`MyTrait`）。"

#: manual/contributing.md:38
msgid "Names should intuitively reflect the function or role of the struct or trait, avoiding overly abstract or non-descriptive names."
msgstr "命名应直观地反映该结构体或特征的功能或角色，避免使用过于抽象或不具描述性的名称。"

#: manual/contributing.md:40
msgid "2.4 Constant naming"
msgstr "2.4 常量命名"

#: manual/contributing.md:42
msgid "**Note:** In the MoonBit context, \"variables\" are typically referred to as \"bindings\" and are immutable by default unless marked with `mut`. Thus, there is no strict distinction between constant and variable naming."
msgstr "**注意：** 由于在 MoonBit 的语境下，“变量”通常称为“binding”，且默认是不可变的，只有添加 `mut` 关键字才能使其可变。因此，常量和“变量”之间没有严格的命名差异，保持一致性。"

#: manual/contributing.md:43
msgid "Use **lowercase letters with underscores** as separators (e.g., `machine_dbl_epsilon`)."
msgstr "常量名采用 **全小写字母和下划线** 分隔（例如：`machine_dbl_epsilon`）。"

#: manual/contributing.md:44
msgid "Prefix constants with a descriptive category where applicable (e.g., `machine_dbl_epsilon`, where `machine` indicates a machine-related constant)."
msgstr "常量名通常以第一个单词作为前缀，表示常量的用途或分类。例如，`machine_dbl_epsilon` 中的 `machine` 表示与机器相关的常量。"

#: manual/contributing.md:45
msgid "Constant names should be concise and descriptive to facilitate understanding."
msgstr "常量名应简洁且具有描述性，便于其他开发者理解。"

#: manual/contributing.md:47
msgid "2.5 Result Err construction and Err code"
msgstr "2.5 Result 的 Err 构造内容和 Err Code"

#: manual/contributing.md:49
msgid "Use **uppercase letters with underscores** as separators (e.g., `E_MAX_ITER`)."
msgstr "采用 **全大写字母和下划线** 分隔（例如：`E_MAX_ITER`）。"

#: manual/contributing.md:50
msgid "Err codes should be prefixed with `E` to indicate an error-related construct."
msgstr "构造内容通常以字符`E`作为前缀，表示其用于 Err 构造或者错误代码。"

#: manual/contributing.md:51
msgid "Err codes should be concise and descriptive for easy comprehension."
msgstr "构造内容应简洁且具有描述性，便于其他开发者理解。"

#: manual/contributing.md:53
msgid "3. Comments"
msgstr "3. 注释"

#: manual/contributing.md:55
msgid "**Conciseness**: Comments should be clear and to the point, avoiding unnecessary verbosity."
msgstr "**简洁性**：注释应简洁明了，只包含必要的信息，避免冗长和不相关的内容。"

#: manual/contributing.md:56
msgid "**Consistency**: Use uniform terminology and style across the codebase."
msgstr "**一致性**：使用一致的术语和风格，避免在不同地方使用不同的方式描述相同的概念。"

#: manual/contributing.md:57
msgid "**Clarity**: Ensure comments are easy to understand, avoiding complex jargon or ambiguous wording."
msgstr "**清晰性**：确保注释易于理解，避免复杂的术语或模糊的表述。应使任何阅读代码的人能够快速理解注释的意图。"

#: manual/contributing.md:58
msgid "**Accuracy**: Comments must accurately reflect the functionality and purpose of the code."
msgstr "**准确性**：注释必须准确反映代码的功能和目的，避免与代码行为不符的描述。"

#: manual/contributing.md:59
msgid "**Up-to-date**: Comments should be updated alongside code changes to maintain relevance."
msgstr "**更新性**：随着代码的变更，注释也应随时更新，确保注释与代码同步。"

#: manual/contributing.md:61
msgid "Developers are encouraged to use MoonBit LSP’s AI-generated code comments to improve efficiency, but AI-generated comments should be reviewed to ensure correctness."
msgstr "我们鼓励开发者采用 MoonBit LSP 提供的 AI 代码注释生成来提升注释的编写效率，但需要开发者对 AI 生成的内容进行审核，以确保其对方法、结构体和特征的解释是正确无误的。"

#: manual/contributing.md:63
msgid "4. File standards"
msgstr "4. 文件规范"

#: manual/contributing.md:65
msgid "4.1 Folder naming"
msgstr "4.1 文件夹命名"

#: manual/contributing.md:67
msgid "Use **lowercase letters** for folder names."
msgstr "对于大的功能模块，请使用小写字母命名的文件夹（包）。"

#: manual/contributing.md:68
msgid "Folder names should be concise, descriptive, and separated using underscores (`_`). Avoid numbers and special characters."
msgstr "文件夹名称应简洁、具有描述性，并使用下划线（`_`）分隔单词。请避免使用数字和特殊字符。"

#: manual/contributing.md:70
#: manual/contributing.md:80
#: manual/contributing.md:96
msgid "Examples:"
msgstr "例如："

#: manual/contributing.md:72
msgid "For differentiation-related functionality: `differentiation`"
msgstr "微分相关功能：`differentiation`"

#: manual/contributing.md:73
msgid "For integration-related functionality: `integration`"
msgstr "积分相关功能：`integration`"

#: manual/contributing.md:75
msgid "4.2 File organization"
msgstr "4.2 文件划分"

#: manual/contributing.md:77
msgid "Files should be organized based on functionality, with each file focusing on a specific feature. Use **lowercase letters with underscores** for file names."
msgstr "文件应该按功能划分，每个文件专注于特定的功能。文件名使用**小写字母和下划线**。"

#: manual/contributing.md:78
msgid "File names should be descriptive and clearly indicate the core functionality they implement."
msgstr "文件名应具备描述性，清楚反映该文件所实现的核心功能。"

#: manual/contributing.md:82
msgid "`gauss_kronrod.mbt`: Implements Gaussian quadrature with Kronrod extension."
msgstr "`gauss_kronrod.mbt`：实现带克龙罗德扩展的高斯求积。"

#: manual/contributing.md:83
msgid "`adaptive_quadrature_gk.mbt`: Implements adaptive quadrature using Gaussian quadrature with Kronrod extension."
msgstr "`adaptive_quadrature_gk.mbt`：使用带克龙罗德扩展的高斯求积实现的自适应积分。"

#: manual/contributing.md:85
msgid "**Note:** Avoid overly generic or vague file names such as `utils.mbt`. Instead, ensure file names correspond to their function or module."
msgstr "**注意**：在文件命名中（除了在@internal 中不可避免的情况），请避免使用过于通用或模糊的名称，如 `utils.mbt`，请尽量使文件名与其功能或模块相关联。"

#: manual/contributing.md:87
msgid "5. Commit guidelines"
msgstr "5. 提交规范"

#: manual/contributing.md:89
msgid "5.1 Commit messages"
msgstr "5.1 提交信息"

#: manual/contributing.md:91
msgid "Use the `ready_to_pr.sh` script before committing to format code, run checks, generate test coverage files, and create `.mbti` files."
msgstr "在提交前请使用 `ready_to_pr.sh` 脚本来自动格式化代码、运行检查、生成测试覆盖率文件和 `.mbti` 文件。"

#: manual/contributing.md:92
msgid "Each commit should have a clear description of the changes made."
msgstr "每个提交应具有清晰的描述，说明此次提交所做的变更。"

#: manual/contributing.md:93
msgid "Commit messages should be in **English**, concise, and precise."
msgstr "提交信息应使用**英文**，并遵循**简短、精炼**的原则。"

#: manual/contributing.md:94
msgid "Use prefixes such as `fix:`, `feat:`, `refactor:`, and `doc:` to indicate the type of change."
msgstr "使用 `fix:`，`feat:`，`refactor:` 和 `doc:` 等前缀来区分提交的类型"

#: manual/contributing.md:105
msgid "5.2 Commit frequency"
msgstr "5.2 提交频率"

#: manual/contributing.md:107
msgid "Keep commits small and focused on a single feature or fix."
msgstr "尽量保持每次提交都很小且聚焦于一个功能或修复。"

#: manual/contributing.md:108
msgid "Avoid large, monolithic commits that include multiple unrelated changes."
msgstr "不要一次性提交大规模的更改。"

#: manual/contributing.md:110
msgid "6. Code review"
msgstr "6. 代码审查"

#: manual/contributing.md:112
msgid "If you are not a maintainer or collaborator, contact them before modifying dependencies or version numbers in `moon.mod`."
msgstr "非项目维护者和合作者在修改`moon.mod`内的依赖和版本号前，请先联系维护者或者合作者。"

#: manual/contributing.md:113
msgid "All code submissions must undergo **code review**."
msgstr "所有的代码提交都必须经过**代码审查**。"

#: manual/contributing.md:114
msgid "Code reviews should focus on code quality, style, performance, and security."
msgstr "在审查过程中，关注代码质量、风格、性能和安全性。"

#: manual/contributing.md:115
msgid "Reviewers should provide constructive feedback to improve the code."
msgstr "审查者应提供建设性的反馈，帮助改进代码。"

