msgstr "[![img](https://img.shields.io/badge/Maintainer-KCN--judu-pink)](https://github.com/KCN-judu) [![img](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-Apache%202.0-blue)](https://github.com/Luna-Flow/calculus-numerical/blob/main/LICENSE) ![img](https://img.shields.io/badge/State-active-success)"

#: manual/index.md:5
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "简介"

#: manual/index.md:7
msgid "This is a numerical calculus library written in [**MoonBit**](https://www.moonbitlang.cn/), designed to fill the gap in the MoonBit ecosystem for scientific computing."
msgstr "这是一个使用[**MoonBit**](https://www.moonbitlang.cn)编写的微积分数值求解库，旨在填补 MoonBit 生态在科学计算领域的空白。"

#: manual/index.md:9
msgid "The library works on functions of type `(Double) -> Double`. The next-generation packages return named results with an error estimate and a status:"
msgstr "本库处理类型为 `(Double) -> Double` 的函数。下一代包返回带有误差估计和状态的具名结果："

#: manual/index.md:11
#: manual/index.md:19
msgid "Package"
msgstr "包"

#: manual/index.md:11
#: manual/index.md:19
msgid "Contents"
msgstr "内容"

#: manual/index.md:13
msgid "The result type `Estimate` and the status `NumericalStatus`."
msgstr "结果类型 `Estimate` 与状态 `NumericalStatus`。"

#: manual/index.md:14
msgid "Fornberg finite-difference weights and Ridders' derivative estimator."
msgstr "Fornberg 有限差分权重和 Ridders 导数估计器。"

#: manual/index.md:15
msgid "The 21-point Gauss–Kronrod rule, adaptive Gauss–Kronrod integration and tanh–sinh integration."
msgstr "21 点 Gauss–Kronrod 求积公式、自适应 Gauss–Kronrod 积分和 tanh–sinh 积分。"

#: manual/index.md:17
msgid "The original API lives in five packages under `legacy/`:"
msgstr "原有 API 位于 `legacy/` 下的五个包中："

#: manual/index.md:21
msgid "The function types `Func_Math` and `Quad_GK` and mathematical constants."
msgstr "函数类型 `Func_Math` 与 `Quad_GK`，以及数学常量。"

#: manual/index.md:22
msgid "Derivatives by forward, backward and central differences from a given initial step size."
msgstr "根据给定的初始步长，以前向、后向和中心差分计算导数。"

#: manual/index.md:23
msgid "Derivatives by forward, backward and central differences with a step size chosen automatically."
msgstr "自动选择步长，以前向、后向和中心差分计算导数。"

#: manual/index.md:24
msgid "Gauss–Kronrod rules and adaptive and non-adaptive integrators."
msgstr "Gauss–Kronrod 求积公式以及自适应与非自适应积分器。"

#: manual/index.md:25
msgid "Machine constants used by the other packages."
msgstr "供其他包使用的机器常量。"

#: manual/index.md:27
msgid "Before this layout the same packages were published as `basic`, `deriv`, `diff`, `integration` and `internal`. Only the import path changed; the functions, types and their behaviour are the same. Import them with, for example, `\"Luna-Flow/calculus-numerical/legacy/deriv\"` instead of `\"Luna-Flow/calculus-numerical/deriv\"`. The top-level `integration` path now holds the next-generation integration package; the old integrators are `legacy/integration`."
msgstr "在此布局之前，这些包以 `basic`、`deriv`、`diff`、`integration` 和 `internal` 之名发布。只有导入路径发生了变化，函数、类型及其行为保持不变。例如，请使用 `\"Luna-Flow/calculus-numerical/legacy/deriv\"` 代替 `\"Luna-Flow/calculus-numerical/deriv\"` 来导入。顶层的 `integration` 路径现在是下一代积分包；原有的积分器是 `legacy/integration`。"

#: manual/index.md:29
msgid "Guides"
msgstr "指南"

#: manual/index.md:31
msgid "[Architecture RFC](architecture_rfc.md): the next-generation architecture under research, an independent, trait-compatible numerical foundation with explicit floating-point contexts and first-class Decimal support."
msgstr "[架构 RFC](architecture_rfc.md)：正在研究的下一代架构，即一个独立的、与 trait 兼容的数值基础，具备显式浮点上下文和一等的 Decimal 支持。"

#: manual/index.md:33
msgid "Feature list"
msgstr "功能列表"

#: manual/index.md:35
msgid "**[Latest]** 25.01.31: Non-adaptive integration implementation (using Gaussian quadrature and Kronrod extension)"
msgstr "**[最新]** 25.01.31: 非自适应积分实现（使用高斯求积法及 Kronrod 扩展）"

#: manual/index.md:37
msgid "**25.01.13**: Adaptive integration implementation (using Gaussian quadrature and Kronrod extension)"
msgstr "**25.01.13**: 自适应积分实现（使用高斯求积法及 Kronrod 扩展）"

#: manual/index.md:38
msgid "**25.01.02**: Quadrature methods implementation (using Gaussian quadrature and Kronrod extension)"
msgstr "**25.01.02**: 求积法实现（使用高斯求积法及 Kronrod 扩展）"

#: manual/index.md:39
msgid "**24.12.30**: Derivatives and differential functionality implementation (using forward, backward, and central difference methods)"
msgstr "**24.12.30**: 导数与微分功能实现（使用前向、后向及中心差分法）"

#: manual/index.md:41
msgid "How to contribute"
msgstr "如何参与贡献"

#: manual/index.md:43
msgid "We welcome contributions from the community, external developers, and individual enthusiasts! Whether you want to fix a bug, add a new feature, or improve the documentation, your participation is highly encouraged. To help you contribute smoothly, here are some simple steps:"
msgstr "我们非常欢迎社区、外部开发者以及个人爱好者的贡献！无论你是想解决某个 bug、增加新功能，还是改进文档，都非常欢迎你的参与。为了帮助你顺利贡献，以下是一些简单的步骤："

#: manual/index.md:45
msgid "Please choose a task from the [`TODO.md`](../../TODO.md) file or the current `issue` list that interests you. We recommend selecting something you are interested in or familiar with, as it will make it easier to get started and enjoy the process."
msgstr "请从 [`TODO.md`](../../TODO.md) 文件或者当前的`issue`列表中挑选一个你感兴趣的任务。我们建议选择自己有兴趣或熟悉的内容，这样你会更容易上手，也能享受其中的过程。"

#: manual/index.md:46
msgid "Fork our project and create a new branch in your personal repository. This way, you can start working on your changes without affecting the main project."
msgstr "Fork 我们的项目，并在你的个人仓库中创建一个新的分支。这样，你就可以在自己的分支上开始进行开发工作，而不会影响到主项目的进展。"

#: manual/index.md:47
msgid "During development, please adhere to the coding style and guidelines in the [contribution guidelines](contributing.md). If your changes involve new features or bug fixes, please make sure to perform thorough testing to ensure everything works as expected."
msgstr "在编写代码过程中，请尽量遵循[贡献指南](contributing.md)中的代码风格和规范。如果你的修改涉及到新功能或修复 bug，请确保进行充分的测试，确保一切正常运行。"

#: manual/index.md:48
msgid "Once you're done, submit your PR and provide a clear description of your changes to help us understand the modifications you've made. This will help us review and merge your code more quickly."
msgstr "完成后，请提交你的 PR，并在提交时提供一个清晰的描述，帮助我们了解你所做的更改。这样有助于更快地进行代码审查和合并。"

#: manual/index.md:49
msgid "We will review your PR and may suggest improvements to ensure code quality. After approval, your contributions will be merged into the main branch."
msgstr "我们会对你的 PR 进行审查，并可能会提出一些改进意见，这只是为了确保代码质量。待审查通过后，我们会将你的贡献合并到主分支中。"

#: manual/index.md:51
msgid "Thank you again for your participation and contributions! Every effort helps make this project better. We look forward to seeing your great code!"
msgstr "再次感谢你的参与和贡献！每一份努力都能让这个项目变得更好。我们期待看到你的精彩代码！"

